# Local scratch and virtualenvs. `.venv*/` rather than `.venv/` because the
# skillspector work creates `.venv-skillspector/`, which is 15k files.
tmp/
.venv*/

# The Scuba control plane. It is mirrored to its own `scuba-state/...` branch,
# deliberately, so that plans and records stay visible without entering `main`'s
# history. Committing it here would fork the mirror.
.scuba/

# The skillgate program is 0.6.0. These paths exist in the working tree today
# and must not reach `main` with 0.5.0. They are ignored rather than merely
# avoided so that the boundary is enforced by the tool instead of remembered by
# the author: a `git add -A` cannot stage what git will not see.
go.work
go.work.sum
skillgate/
skills/skill-gate/
